{"text": "The Light.\n\nLina goes up. She is very quiet. Her heart beats fast.\n\nThe blue door is open now. Behind it, there are more steps. They are old and dark.\n\nAt the top, there is a yellow light. Lina feels the cold night on her face.\n\nShe takes one more step. Then she stops.\n\nShe is on the roof!\n\nThere are little lights everywhere. Under the lights, there is a garden. There are red tomatoes and long green beans. There are many plants and flowers.\n\nA small old woman stands in the garden. She gives water to the tomatoes.\n\nIt is Mrs Ada!\n\n\"Good evening, Lina,\" she says. She is not surprised.\n\n\"You sleep at eight?\" asks Lina.\n\nMrs Ada laughs. \"Not really. Sorry, dear.\"\n\n\"No one lives here,\" says Mrs Ada. \"Only my tomatoes and beans.\"\n\nLina laughs, too. Mrs Ada is right!\n\nThen Mrs Ada opens her hand. There are two keys in it.\n\n\"One key is for me,\" she says. \"One key is for you.\"\n\n\"For me? Why?\"\n\nMrs Ada looks down. Lina looks down, too. She sees her small window. She sees her red pot.\n\n\"I see your poor flower every day. It needs sun. The sun is here.\"\n\nNow Lina's flower is on the roof. It is next to the tomatoes.\n\nA week later, there is a new leaf.\n\nLina smiles. She has a key. She has a garden. And she has a friend.", "textSha256": "fb93c9054e2f87369291a124aad1ed8147ffb73e25739464d4c680f47051031b", "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "speed": 0.9, "lang": "en", "parts": 1, "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "L", "i", "g", "h", "t", ".", "\n", "\n", "L", "i", "n", "a", " ", "g", "o", "e", "s", " ", "u", "p", ".", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "q", "u", "i", "e", "t", ".", " ", "H", "e", "r", " ", "h", "e", "a", "r", "t", " ", "b", "e", "a", "t", "s", " ", "f", "a", "s", "t", ".", "\n", "\n", "T", "h", "e", " ", "b", "l", "u", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", " ", "i", "s", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", " ", "n", "o", "w", ".", " ", "B", "e", "h